Usage in Substrate:
  oasdiff powers the semantic OpenAPI breaking-change detection engine in
  engine/internal/diff/openapi.go via the checker.CheckBackwardCompatibilityUntilLevel
  function. The oasdiff library is used as a Go module dependency and is not
  modified. Its 37+ semantic rules are mapped to Substrate's DiffReport format
  via the mapOasdiffRule function.

